  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/lieon-studios-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhttps%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fmore-stick-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/badge/requires-mstv.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<img width=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lieonlion.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Fishing-Rod-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<sup><img width=\"5\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/separator_v.svg\">pnku:</sup>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pnku.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/pnku_de_logo.svg\" alt=\"pnku.de\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/desc_hr_top.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>更多（钓鱼）竿变体</h1>\n<p>钓鱼和骑乘猪或炽足兽——但以你想要的方式！<br>\n你将什么<em>木棍</em>绑定<em>线</em>，也许再加上一根<em>胡萝卜</em>或一个<em>诡异菌</em>——现在由<strong>你</strong>来决定！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Fishing-Rod-Variants/pres/mr_desc_banner.png\" alt=\"\"> 海滩场景展示了几种新添加的<em>钓鱼竿</em>和<em>胡萝卜/诡异菌钓竿</em>物品，使用了'<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-armor-stand-variants%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多盔甲架变体</a>'和'<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farmor-stands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">盔甲架</a>'（用于布置），由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fRoundaround\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">roundaround</a> 制作。</p>\n<h2>向 Minecraft 添加了 11 种新的<em>钓鱼竿</em>、11 种新的<em>胡萝卜钓竿</em>物品和 11 种新的<em>诡异菌钓竿</em>物品。</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Fishing-Rod-Variants/pres/cf_desc_pres_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/zear1.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;苍白橡木纹理由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><em>hunnycakehorse</em></strong></a> 提供</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/desc_hr_bottom.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>",
